  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fond f&#xf6;r mindre projekt Kuba 2021-2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund for small contributions Cuba 2021-2023 - Transitos Habana, Memory Wax &amp; Danza Teatro Retazos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att finansiera sm&#xe5; och korta initiativ/projekt som &#xe4;r strategiska f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av Strategi f&#xf6;r Sveriges utvecklingssamarbete med Kuba 2021-2025, men som faller utanf&#xf6;r ramen f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;rre bidrag i respektive resultatomr&#xe5;den.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the contribution is to finance small and short initiatives/projects on Cuba which are strategic to the implementation of the Strategy for Sweden&#x2019;s development cooperation with Cuba 2021-2025 but that fall outside the framework of the larger contributions in the respective results areas.</narrative>
  </description>
